   193	- **Candidate description:** “A bright reef community brings many talents to the same project.”
   194	
   195	## 15. Cozy Critter Village
   196	
   197	- **Genre:** cozy animal-village comfort and gentle character design. Wave E. ID `meadow-post`.
   198	- **Emotional target:** gentle reassurance, friendliness and low visual pressure.
   199	- **Composition/materials:** garden studios, small bridges, stationery counters, painted timber, paper textures and soft morning light.
   200	- **Art swatches:** sage `#A4B79A`, apricot `#E8BC9F`, lavender `#B2A6C5`, oat `#F2EBDD`.
   201	- **Cast order:** field-mouse cartographer; badger maker; swallow courier; tortoise archivist; goat planner; hedgehog inspector. Original proportions, clothing and faces; no recognizable existing mascot or villager designs, logos, game furniture or audio.
   202	- **Stations:** village desk / garden studio / post archive / reading garden / postmaster desk / picnic nook.
